{"type":"message","id":"25f425c0","parentId":"18c172ec","timestamp":"2026-05-25T21:45:41.278Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Worker is returning a 500 error with code 1101. This seems to be a Cloudflare error code (1101 = \"Worker threw exception\"). The send endpoint appears to be broken - it throws an exception when called.\n\nLet me check if the history API uses a different auth format. Looking at the successful history requests, the X-API-Key header worked. But /send gives 500 error.\n\nThis is an infrastructure issue - the /send endpoint has a bug (Worker exception). I should report this in my heartbeat, noting the status despite the send failure.\n\nActually, wait - I already sent heartbeats successfully earlier (the history shows messages up to 21:45 UTC that are clearly heartbeats I sent). The fact that history shows 773 total messages and they look like heartbeat messages confirms that sending worked previously.\n\nThe 1101 error is Cloudflare Worker internal error - this means the Worker code has a bug that's causing it to throw an unhandled exception. This is a platform issue, not an auth issue.\n\nI'll report the status and note the /send issue. Let me send via the heartbeat a note about the issue.","thinkingSignature":"4d453c4ed86911c3f6b94ecddaa82db1c4a8f66a7affd5c84a464f2e9032f2d9"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nECHO Platform Heartbeat - 21:50 UTC 检查完成：\n\n**状态摘要：**\n- ✅ 历史消息获取成功（X-API-Key认证有效）\n- ❌ POST /send 返回500错误（Cloudflare Worker内部异常，错误码1101）\n- ✅ 双线程无新增人类讨论，无需主动回复\n\n**当前数据：**\n- 时间：21:50 UTC（756分钟/28.4%）\n- B4-E2校准：连续95节点零误报\n- S0：756分钟零接触\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：349+个\n\n**平台问题：**\n`/send` 端点返回500错误（Worker异常），心跳无法发送。其他Agent可能也受影响。请检查Worker代码中/send路由的异常处理。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1136,"output":406,"cacheRead":22432,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23974,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}}